    "detailed_description": "In the world of lightness and darkness, Let's make a Path by connect the dots.<br><br>Move the dots to draw curve  pass the gate.<br><br>May be multiple paths pass the gate.<br>Able to get pass all the gates in one path, or all take different paths.<br>Please make sure of each curve drawn by moving dots.<br><br>This game has many ways to move the points.<br>Sometimes move just one dot, or move several dots at once.<br>Symmetric moving, Manipulate the radius of the circle and more methods.<br>May be some dots that cannot be move.<br><br>You will always find a path to a goal.<br>No time limit so no need to rush.<br>All it takes is a little imagination.<br>Just relax and play.<br><br>Let's start your journey to lead the light.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > How to Play </h2>The goal of this puzzle is passing all the gates using curves derived from lines that connecting points.<br>You have to do is to adjust curves by moving points.<br>You can play in a relaxed atmosphere.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Move points<br>Keyboard: WASD, Arrows<br>Game pad: Left stick<br></li><li> Switch points<br>Keyboard: QE, ZC, Space<br>Mouse: Wheel<br>Game pad: LB/RB, L3<br></li><li>Move a camera<br>Keyboard: Ctrl+WASD, Ctrl+Arrows<br>Mouse: Move<br>Game pad: Right stick<br></li><li> Show Settings<br>Keyboard: Escape<br>Mouse: Middle button<br>Game pad: Start</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type of Points/h2]<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/edcb654a4179eb903894ac2e0e3464f7.avif?t=1723597745\" width=64 height=64 /></span><li> Move a point.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/fd22caa6c2ea3dcc1433bb4f06eeb1bd.avif?t=1723597745\" width=128 height=64 /></span><br></li><li> Move two points with line symmetry.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/0785ecec8144a2f00f84d6e17a69cb18.avif?t=1723597745\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br></li><li> Move two points with point symmetry.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/440198ecb91580b0d2b87456cafce5ab.avif?t=1723597745\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br></li><li> Move multiple points by changing the radius and angle of the circle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/c75bcf1fcb4dcc68b04536fbe5d0c47b.avif?t=1723597745\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br></li><li> Move multiple points by changing the center of the circle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/b0353ca0bf0c042ab8721a8da7a5634d.avif?t=1723597745\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br></li><li> A single fixed point.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/ef4c80988dca5e18dd14709922b3c178.avif?t=1723597745\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br></li><li> A pair of movable and fixed points.</li></ul></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "In the world of lightness and darkness, Let's make a Path by connect the dots.<br><br>Move the dots to draw curve  pass the gate.<br><br>May be multiple paths pass the gate.<br>Able to get pass all the gates in one path, or all take different paths.<br>Please make sure of each curve drawn by moving dots.<br><br>This game has many ways to move the points.<br>Sometimes move just one dot, or move several dots at once.<br>Symmetric moving, Manipulate the radius of the circle and more methods.<br>May be some dots that cannot be move.<br><br>You will always find a path to a goal.<br>No time limit so no need to rush.<br>All it takes is a little imagination.<br>Just relax and play.<br><br>Let's start your journey to lead the light.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > How to Play </h2>The goal of this puzzle is passing all the gates using curves derived from lines that connecting points.<br>You have to do is to adjust curves by moving points.<br>You can play in a relaxed atmosphere.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Move points<br>Keyboard: WASD, Arrows<br>Game pad: Left stick<br></li><li> Switch points<br>Keyboard: QE, ZC, Space<br>Mouse: Wheel<br>Game pad: LB/RB, L3<br></li><li>Move a camera<br>Keyboard: Ctrl+WASD, Ctrl+Arrows<br>Mouse: Move<br>Game pad: Right stick<br></li><li> Show Settings<br>Keyboard: Escape<br>Mouse: Middle button<br>Game pad: Start</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type of Points/h2]<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/edcb654a4179eb903894ac2e0e3464f7.avif?t=1723597745\" width=64 height=64 /></span><li> Move a point.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029480/extras/fd22caa6c2ea3dcc1433bb4f06eeb1bd.avif?t=1723597745\" width=128 height=64 /></span><br></li><li> Move two points with line symmetry.<br><br><s